  "what_this_is": "Four-row engineering form smoke of the cell B7a RECOVERY on the fixed code (E8c, commit 2af5955a, merged 5bbd54a2). Byte-for-byte the recovery full-cell baseline configs/baseline/slurp-native-anchor-ncp-l1-train-fold-a-recovery-v1.json except its own native_contact_fit identity with the 4 x 11 x 4 = 176 endpoint ceiling the four-row roster resizes, its own two speech-feature identity ids, its own prepared_phase_supply pin and this note. It exists only so the full cell's FIT and generation accounting is never charged smoke contacts. It re-proves the structural form on the fixed commit and NOTHING MORE: it cannot reach the illegal-action path. When this roster flew on 2026-09-17 at study commit ea84dcd5 its four rows produced six Planner responses, three rows ACCEPT at five contacts and one row REVISE then ACCEPT at nine, every one a registered action; a four-row roster that routes only registered actions cannot exercise the disposition E8c adds. The illegal-action path is therefore proved model-free, by tests/unit/test_ojw_native_episode.py::test_malformed_planner_action_seals_the_row_instead_of_failing_the_flight and tests/unit/test_flight_native_episode_dispatch.py::test_an_illegal_planner_token_seals_its_row_and_the_campaign_continues, and by the recovery note's own fake-model dispatch receipt over this same four-row roster -- never by this smoke. No official scoring job and no task-quality read is admitted here.",
